# Quality Checklist

Before completing any task, verify:

## Code

- TypeScript passes
- No unused imports
- No broken imports
- No no-op buttons
- No hardcoded localhost URLs
- No fake data unless clearly marked as seed/demo
- No duplicated large logic

## Mobile

- Expo starts
- No red screen
- Navigation works
- iOS safe area works
- Keyboard does not hide forms
- Tab bar does not cover actions
- Loading states exist
- Error states exist
- Empty states exist

## Backend

- DTO validation exists
- Role checks exist
- Ownership checks exist
- Errors are meaningful
- Prisma queries are safe
- Transactions used for critical flows

## UX

- User can understand what to do
- Buttons do what they say
- Disabled buttons explain why
- No screen looks like placeholder unless intentionally marked
- Brand colors are consistent

## Definition of done

A task is not done until:
- it compiles
- it runs
- main flow is tested
- changed files are summarized
- known limitations are documented